nt-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:0px 0px 5px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\">随着老龄化趋势愈发加快，整个社会趋向“衰老型”发展，空巢老人的现象也日益加剧。养老问题已经成为事关我国经济社会发展全局的大事和要事，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#0391e3;visibility:visible;\">养老产业不仅是一项\"朝阳产业\"，更是一项\"民生事业\"！</span>数字化已经成为养老产业新的发展热点，是目前中国养老产业发展中的一个重要方向。</section><section style=\"margin:0px 0px 5px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\">本次<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#0391e3;visibility:visible;\">温江区民政局智慧健康养老信息化平台</span>升级改造项目中，古河云科技结合在智慧领域多年来的技术沉淀，通过平台精简业务流程，优化服务项目，科学规范管理，根据养老机构的业务流程、服务项目、管理要求等特点，开发出面向居家老人、社区、机构的，提供实时、快捷、高效、物联化、智能化的养老服务，提高了养老机构业务处理效率和管理效率，减少了资源浪费，提升了竞争力。<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#0391e3;visibility:visible;\">实现了“系统+服务+老人+终端”的智慧养老服务模式，将政府、企业、社会、社区、家庭、个人连接起来，满足老年人多样化、多层次的养老需求。</span></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;visibility:visible;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0