rgin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">疫情防控管理系统的设计与实现，能够有效地对随访人员进行疫情监督；使相关部门做到防患于未然，保障人员安全。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">同时主管部门能够对下属部门的防疫开展情况进行在线的查看、统计；对历史出访人员的出入情况回溯；结合手机移动端实现健康码上报、核算上报、高风险区域人员预警、探访人员的疫情筛查、准入等功能。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-15/20224151411262440.png\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;color:#008fdb;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">02</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:2px 2px 2px 7px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;align-self:flex-end;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:10%;height:auto;border-bottom:1px solid #008fdb;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">安全巡更</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">传统的巡更方式依靠员工的自觉性，作为管理者难以进行有效、公平合理的监督管理，从而形同虚设。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">安全巡更系统将每一次巡更记录都存档备份；帮助管理者优化巡更监管的工作流程；将巡逻巡检工作规范化，提升科学管理水平，有效地保障了巡更工作的有序开展。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-15/20224151411272961.png\" alt=\"3\" title=\"3\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sa